# Default owner for everything in this repository.
#
# ⚠️ ACTION REQUIRED: replace @your-github-handle with a real GitHub username or team. GitHub
# silently ignores owners that do not resolve, so until this is replaced the file has no effect and
# nothing will appear broken.
#
# This only takes effect once "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled in the branch protection
# rules for the default branch.

*                       @your-github-handle

# Highest blast radius: CI and the production image.
/.github/               @your-github-handle
/Dockerfile             @your-github-handle
/.dockerignore          @your-github-handle

# The secrets policy and the ignore rules are security-relevant.
/SECURITY.md            @your-github-handle
/.gitignore             @your-github-handle
